 ● This is an Instagram/Facebook Chatbot SaaS Platform built with Spring Boot. Here's what I learned:

   Overview

   A multi-tenant platform for managing Instagram and Facebook chatbot integrations. Businesses can register, connect their Meta accounts, and configure automated chatbot flows.

   Technology Stack

     - Backend: Spring Boot 3.2.3, Java 17
     - Database: PostgreSQL with Flyway migrations
     - Key Libraries: Spring Web, JPA, Validation, WebFlux, Lombok

   Core Architecture

   Entities: Business, Customer, ChatbotFlow, FlowStep, Conversation, ConversationData, Message

   Key Services:

     - OAuthService - Meta OAuth 2.0 integration
     - WebhookService - Handles Instagram/Facebook webhooks
     - MessageHandlerService - Processes incoming messages
     - ChatbotFlowService - Manages configurable bot flows
     - ConversationService - Tracks user conversations

   API Features (see API.md):

     - Business registration & management
     - Meta OAuth flow (authorize/callback/refresh)
     - Webhook verification & event handling
     - Chatbot flow creation with steps
     - Conversation & customer tracking
     - Data collection from conversations

   The platform allows businesses to create automated chatbot conversations, collect data from users, and manage multiple customers through Instagram/Facebook messaging.

